{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945430/extras/S0.gif?t=1745176133\" /><br>&quot;Wukong UP&quot; is a dark fantasy parkour game that supports multiplayer online play, supporting up to 4 people online. Sun Wukong made a big fuss in the Heavenly Palace and was later suppressed at the foot of Wuzhi Mountain.<br>The trapped Wukong used his remaining magic power to create a clone in an attempt to save himself.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945430/extras/S4.gif?t=1745176133\" /><br>The player is about to control the clone of Sun Wukong. The goal is to find and break Tathagata's seal and rescue the trapped Sun Wukong.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945430/extras/S5.gif?t=1745176133\" /><br>Players will sprint, jump and solve puzzles to reach the highest point to unlock Buddha's seal to save Wukong.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945430/extras/S2.gif?t=1745176133\" /><br>In the multiplayer online mode, players will be tied together and need to cooperate with other players to overcome levels.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945430/extras/S3.gif?t=1745176133\" /><br>Now, come and invite your friends to rescue Wukong together!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2945430?t=1745176133","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745176133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745176133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745176133","categories":[{"description":"Si